  <title>Electron energy loss spectra of several organic compounds</title>
  <summary ref="https://zenodo.org/records/3975762">
    <experimenter>Amara Diallo</experimenter>
    <instrument pid="FEI-Titan-STEM">FEI Titan STEM</instrument>
    <reservationStart>2026-03-27T17:39:18-06:00</reservationStart>
    <reservationEnd>2026-03-27T17:41:02-06:00</reservationEnd>
    <motivation>We placed crystals of different compounds to explore the possibility of fingerprinting them through EELS. Here are representative datasets of 7 different compounds: b-cyclodextrin hexacarboxy cyclohexane tannin TH-15 peptide TH-27 peptide two different forms of piroxicam The datasets were collected at EMAT, using a monochromated FEI Titan 3 TEM, within the scope of an EUSMI request.

Data source: &lt;a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.3975762"&gt;https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.3975762&lt;/a&gt;

CC BY 4.0.</motivation>
